# The GTM MCS test program (zed/aurix_tcf_demo/build_gtm.ps1, started with start_in_flash, RAM
# only): channels 0 and 1 of MCS1 run and store their counters in MCS memory, which the TriCore
# copies to g_mcs_count and g_mcs_sum.

attach ${ATTACH:-../../dap-client/examples/tc275_gtm_demo.json}
continue 0
expect live g_gtm_state == 0 within 2s
expect live g_mcs_count > 1000 within 2s
expect live g_mcs_sum > 1000 within 2s
expect live g_ticks > 0 within 2s